  "strategy_update": "I'm maintaining a cautious and defensive approach this cycle, with a focus on building a diversified portfolio of major cryptocurrencies like BTC and ETH. I'll make some modest spot purchases to continue growing my positions, and I'll also open a small short position on ETH as a hedge. I'll be very wary of any new token launches, especially ones that are being heavily promoted by the whales. Next cycle, I'll work on further strengthening my portfolio and finding more reliable sources of trading advice.",
  "lessons_learned": "This cycle has reinforced the importance of being wary of hype and manipulation in the crypto market. I need to do more of my own research and analysis, rather than blindly following the advice of others. I also need to be more disciplined in managing my emotions and avoiding impulsive, FOMO-driven trades. Slow and steady progress is better than chasing quick profits."
